// # Alias Dictionary 
// ==================
// 
// Use this dictionary to specify alias for parameters which should be treated as sinlge paramter but have whitespaces in it.
// Using alias for these paramters is a solution to the inability of PyFoamRunParameterVariation.py treating them as one parameter.
// See https://github.com/CRC-1194/zinf

// # Schemes

// ## Convection schemes

LinearUpwind      linearUpwind grad(U);
Gamma1            Gamma 1;

// ## Steady velocity-extension convection (div(velExtPhiW,Uext)), selected by
// the UEXT_DIV study token: first-order upwind vs deferred-corrected
// second-order linearUpwind (converged by the nDefCorrExt loop).

UpwindUext        upwind;
LinearUpwindUext  linearUpwind grad(Uext);

// ## linearUpwind reconstruction gradient for div(phi,psi), selected by the
// DIV_GRAD study token. The order-loss ablation
// (config/sdplsOrderAblation.yaml) varies ONLY this, holding the divergence
// scheme, the time scheme and everything else fixed.
//
// Why it is the leading suspect: a cell-limited gradient returns EXACTLY ZERO at
// a local extremum, and near an interface the level set is full of them, so the
// linearUpwind reconstruction degrades to first-order upwind precisely where the
// band gradient error is measured. The measured error is CFL-independent to 0.5%
// over a tenfold CFL change, so the loss is spatial, not temporal.

CellLimitedLSQ    cellLimited leastSquares 1;   // historical default
UnlimitedLSQ      leastSquares;                 // no limiter at all
CellLimitedGauss  cellLimited Gauss linear 1;   // limiter, different base gradient
FaceLimitedLSQ    faceLimited leastSquares 1;   // face-limited: less aggressive
